hile running, yet the footage remains stable, emphasized by the text, “Super Steady Video,” with a person walking dogs appearing on-screen. A couple reviews smooth footage of dogs playing. The scene then transitions to a nighttime campsite, where a user records video in low light, highlighted by the text “Nightography Video.” The camera lenses are shown with specifications including the texts, “F1.4,” “50MP Tele 10X,” “200MP Wide,” “50MP Ultra Wide,” and “10MP Tele 3X,” with upgraded pro cameras featuring up to a 47% brighter aperture, along with a disclaimer stating, “Tele 3x is optical zoom. Tele 10x is optical-quality zoom.” A zoom into the lens reveals bright, clear footage of people cooking and enjoying a party at night. Photos captured on the device are displayed, and a man and woman review them at the campsite as the “Galaxy AI” logo appears. The phone interface then shows Photo Assist in action, typing “Add my dog” text inserts a dog into a photo, “Change to daytime” text transforms the lighting, “Birthday party in wonderland” text changes the scene to a fantasy setting, and “Add birthday sunglasses on dog” text adds accessories to the dog, along with the disclaimer stating, “Photo Assist requires a network connection and Samsung Account login. Service availability may vary by country, language or device model. Photo Assist may result in a resized photo. A visible watermark is overlaid on the image output upon saving in order to indicate that the image is generated by AI. The accuracy and reliability of the generated output is not guaranteed.” The Creative Studio feature is introduced with the text, “The creative process is in full swing…” then showing a UI where a selected photo generates multiple dog-character emojis, which are then applied as stickers on the actual picture, along with the disclaimer stating, “Creative Studio feature requires a network connection and Samsung Account login. Service availability may vary by country, language or device model. The accuracy and reliability of the generated output is not guaranteed. Sticker sets only compatible with Samsung keyboard and can only be shared via Quick Share feature with other Galaxy devices that have One UI 5.0 or later installed and Quick Share app version 13.8.50 x or later.” These emojis are also used in messaging. The scene shifts indoors, where “Now Nudge” text appears as a user types on their phone. A message suggesting “Luneyard Cafe” triggers a quick-access map. The user checks details and easily shares photos through the interface, along with the disclaimer stating, “Now Nudge feature requires a Samsung Account login. Available functions and features may vary by country, region, and language. Text message prompts available with certain third-party messaging apps including Samsung Messages, Google Messages, Google Chat, WhatsApp, WhatsApp Business, KakaoTalk, LINE, Signal, Instagram (DM), Tango, NTT Docomo Messages, and KDDI Messages. Share photos in Now Nudge works by analyzing available image content. Accuracy of results is not guaranteed.” The same user is then shown lying on a bed using the phone as “Now Brief” text appears. The interface displays a daily summary with the text “Morning brief. Start your day with this briefing,” allowing the user to scroll through their schedule, along with the disclaimer stating, “Now Brief requires Samsung Account login. Service availability may vary by country, language or device model, or apps. Some features may require a network connection. Recalled data is available from Notifications, Messages, Gmail, and Samsung Wallet. Notifications must be switched on for recalled data to be enabled. Recalled data collected from Gmail is only applicable if the user consents to Personal Data Intelligent\u0027s Gmail read permission. The description of photos provided by moments may not align with the user\u0027s intent. Events schedule notification is supported with calendar apps that utilize Android calendar database and available if Samsung Calendar is installed. Notifications for dog walking require SmartTag2 and Pet Care in SmartThings needs to be activated. SmartTag2 sold separately.” The camera zooms into the interface and then pulls back to reveal multiple Samsung device interfaces, transitioning into a security segment labeled “Samsung Knox.” A chipset appears with a shield icon, representing protection. The view zooms out to the Galaxy S26 Ultra, which rotates to show its rear camera and side profile once again. The text, “The New Galaxy S26 Ultra” and the “Galaxy AI” logo appear, followed by the Samsung logo to close the video, along with a disclaimer stating, “Samsung account login may be required for certain AI features. Availability of Galaxy AI features may vary depending on the region/country, OS/One UI version, device model, and phone carrier.” In addition to the disclaimers mentioned above, the following disclaimers apply: “Image simulated for illustrative purposes,” “Sequence shortened,” “Actual UI/UX may differ,” and “Results may vary depending on light conditions and/or shooting conditions.”","thumbnailUrl":"https://images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/offer/26_sw_1h_f04_01_ft11_aimomentfilm_mx_720x405.jpg","contentUrl":"https://youtu.be/2gYqEi8-am4","inLanguage":"en-PK","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Samsung","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.samsung.com/etc.clientlibs/samsung/clientlibs/consumer/global/clientlib-common/resources/images/logo-square-letter.png"},"@id":"https://www.samsung.com/pk/#org"}}</script>

				
			
				
					
						<div class="video" data-image-default="false" data-video-embed="false" data-video-type="youtube" data-video-data='{
							"id": "YCLJk_6FGwo",
							"title": "This video depicts a gripping moment in a soccer match where a goalkeeper saves a critical penalty kick. As the audience and commentators watch in suspense, the scene highlights how viewers can enjoy a more immersive experience by using the AI Soccer Mode on a Samsung TV to check real-time player data, such as save ratios. The video concludes with the sharp picture quality of the Mini LED and the tagline, \&#34;Your command, your match.\&#34;",
							"caption": "The video opens with the text “Samsung presents,” revealing a packed stadium filled with cheering fans, along with a disclaimer stating, “This video includes AI-generated content for illustrative purposes only.” It cuts to soccer players entering the field, with Galaxy AI enhancing the visuals to highlight clearer details and improved clarity as they walk into the stadium. The scene then shifts to the crowd and the soccer match in progress. The scene cuts to the commentators, then to the crowd, and then to the soccer players, all visibly energized. The scene cuts to a single shot of a soccer ball, then to a zoomed-out view of a player ready for a penalty kick. The scene cuts to the commentator speaking enthusiastically, then to the goalkeeper anxiously preparing for the kick, and then to a man in the crowd visibly annoyed at the commentator’s statements. The man in the crowd presses a Galaxy AI button on the armrest and demands to mute the commentary. The scene cuts to the commentator disappearing and replaced by the Galaxy AI logo. The scene cuts back to the soccer players ready for the penalty kick. The scene zooms out from a high-clarity close-up of the goalkeeper to reveal the Mini LED screen, displaying On-screen text at the bottom left corner that reads, “What’s Alonso’s save ratio this season?” next to the Bixby logo. The scene cuts to a living room where the man who used to be in the crowd sits with his friends on the couch. Then back to the Mini LED screen, in which Bixby responds with, “Alonso has a 72% save ratio, which is ranked 2nd among goalkeepers this season,” and suggests related content at the bottom of the screen, along with the following disclaimers stating, “Images simulated for illustrative purposes,” “Feature available in certain regions and models,” “Availability, supported features, and user interface may vary by country, region, model, and viewing conditions,” “Voice commands recognize English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Italian, and Korean, but not all accents, dialects, and expressions are recognized,” “This feature provides AI-created content, with accuracy not guaranteed —please check results,” “Requires certain Bluetooth remote (sold separately on some models),” “In-box remote for some models does not support voice recognition. Requires either a Mobile Quick Remote or separately purchased Bluetooth remote,” “Feature accessible via the AI button, or the Home button (long press) on remote control without an AI button,” and “The voice in this video may differ from the actual VAC service.” The scene returns to the penalty kick in slow-motion, in which the goalkeeper successfully catches the soccer ball in mid-air. Then it cuts back to the group of friends in the living room, cheering after watching the save on display, and zooms out to a living room shot as the Mini LED stands centered against a minimal background, and the On-screen text at the center reads, “Your command, your match. AI Soccer Mode.” The scene sharply cuts to on-screen text that reads, “The answer to your thrilling moments.” The scene cuts to a close-up shot of the Mini LED’s screen displaying an abstract visualization showcasing the highly detailed display and sleek frame, and transitions to a clean product shot of the Mini LED with On-screen text that reads, “Mini LED” and “Samsung Vision AI”. The video closes with a black screen with the Samsung logo. In addition to the disclaimers mentioned above, the following disclaimers apply: “All teams and characters appearing in this video are fictitious,” “Screen images simulated for illustrative purposes,” “Feature availability and performance may vary by the content you&#39;re watching or the application in use,” and “UI is subject to change. Actual UI may differ.”",
							"autoplay": false}'>
						</div>
					
					
					
					
						
					
  <script type="application/ld+json" data-type="seo" data-object-type="VideoObject" data-id="f883b030-93e7-4eef-839b-0b93619166da">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"VideoObject","uploadDate":"2026-05-13T16:27:20+0900","name":"This video depicts a gripping moment in a soccer match where a goalkeeper saves a critical penalty kick. As the audience and commentators watch in suspense, the scene highlights how viewers can enjoy a more immersive experience by using the AI Soccer Mode on a Samsung TV to check real-time player data, such as save ratios. The video concludes with the sharp picture quality of the Mini LED and the tagline, \"Your command, your match.\"","description":"The video opens with the text “Samsung presents,” revealing a packed stadium filled with cheering fans, along with a disclaimer stating, “This video includes AI-generated content for illustrative purposes only.” It cuts to soccer players entering the field, with Galaxy AI enhancing the visuals to highlight clearer details and improved clarity as they walk into the stadium. The scene then shifts to the crowd and the soccer match in progress. The scene cuts to the commentators, then to the crowd, and then to the soccer players, all visibly energized. The scene cuts to a single shot of a soccer ball, then to a zoomed-out view of a player ready for a penalty kick. The scene cuts to the commentator speaking enthusiastically, then to the goalkeeper anxiously preparing for the kick, and then to a man in the crowd visibly annoyed at the commentator’s statements. The man in the crowd presses a Galaxy AI button on the armrest and demands to mute the commentary. The scene cuts to the commentator disappearing and replaced by the Galaxy AI logo. The scene cuts back to the soccer players ready for the penalty kick. The scene zooms out from a high-clarity close-up of the goalkeeper to reveal the Mini LED screen, displaying On-screen text at the bottom left corner that reads, “What’s Alonso’s save ratio this season?” next to the Bixby logo. The scene cuts to a living room where the man who used to be in the crowd sits with his friends on the couch. Then back to the Mini LED screen, in which Bixby responds with, “Alonso has a 72% save ratio, which is ranked 2nd among goalkeepers this season,” and suggests related content at the bottom of the screen, along with the following disclaimers stating, “Images simulated for illustrative purposes,” “Feature available in certain regions and models,” “Availability, supported features, and user interface may vary by country, region, model, and viewing conditions,” “Voice commands recognize English, French, Spanish, Portuguese, German, Italian, and Korean, but not all accents, dialects, and expressions are recognized,” “This feature provides AI-created content, with accuracy not guaranteed —please check results,” “Requires certain Bluetooth remote (sold separately on some models),” “In-box remote for some models does not support voice recognition. Requires either a Mobile Quick Remote or separately purchased Bluetooth remote,” “Feature accessible via the AI button, or the Home button (long press) on remote control without an AI button,” and “The voice in this video may differ from the actual VAC service.” The scene returns to the penalty kick in slow-motion, in which the goalkeeper successfully catches the soccer ball in mid-air. Then it cuts back to the group of friends in the living room, cheering after watching the save on display, and zooms out to a living room shot as the Mini LED stands centered against a minimal background, and the On-screen text at the center reads, “Your command, your match. AI Soccer Mode.” The scene sharply cuts to on-screen text that reads, “The answer to your thrilling moments.” The scene cuts to a close-up shot of the Mini LED’s screen displaying an abstract visualization showcasing the highly detailed display and sleek frame, and transitions to a clean product shot of the Mini LED with On-screen text that reads, “Mini LED” and “Samsung Vision AI”. The video closes with a black screen with the Samsung logo. In addition to the disclaimers mentioned above, the following disclaimers apply: “All teams and characters appearing in this video are fictitious,” “Screen images simulated for illustrative purposes,” “Feature availability and performance may vary by the content you\u0027re watching or the application in use,” and “UI is subject to change. Actual UI may differ.”","thumbnailUrl":"https://images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/offer/26_sw_1h_f04_02_ft11_aimomentfilm_vd_720x405.jpg","contentUrl":"https://youtu.be/YCLJk_6FGwo","inLanguage":"en-PK","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Samsung","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://www.samsung.com/etc.clientlibs/samsung/clientlibs/consumer/global/clientlib-common/resources/images/logo-square-letter.png"},"@id":"https://www.samsung.com/pk/#org"}}</script>

				
			
				
					
						<div class="video" data-image-default="false" data-video-embed="false" data-video-type="youtube" data-video-data='{
							"id": "GIMuv7XOXRE",
							"title": "A lifestyle storytelling video showcasing a couple with contrasting personalities, demonstrating how Samsung’s Bespoke AI seamlessly enhances their everyday life through smart, connected home experiences.",
							"caption": "The video opens with the text “Samsung presents” following with the text “Bespoke AI”. It shows a bright, minimal home interior where a man is maintaining a bonsai tree. The scene zooms into a woman on a stationary bike behind him, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Air conditioner) A cool collected man meets a fiery, passionate woman.” The scene transitions to the woman stretching on a mat with the Bespoke AI WindFree Pro installed in the background. The scene cuts to a single shot of the Bespoke AI WindFree Pro on the AI Motion Wind feature with the text, “AI Motion Wind. AI Direct Wind follows user with targeted cooling,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Air conditioner) So in her space, she gets my Direct Wind,” along with a disclaimer stating, “AI Motion Wind refers to AI Direct and AI Indirect wind modes, which operate in AI Auto Mode.” The scene transitions to the man maintaining a bonsai tree with the Bespoke AI WindFree Pro installed in the background along with the text, “AI Motion Wind. AI Indirect Wind ensures targeted user to stay comfortable without direct breeze,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Air conditioner) In his, he gets my Indirect Wind.” The scene cuts to the woman entering a laundry room, opening the Bespoke AI Laundry Combo door, and taking out her clothes out. A man appears beside her and both are rearranging their laundry, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Laundry Combo) Their styles could not be more different.” The man opens the Bespoke AI Laundry Combo door, puts his clothes inside, and closes the door, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Laundry Combo) Just toss it in!” He then presses the ON button from the display stating the text, “Detecting laundry…” The scene shows the text “AI Wash &amp; Dry+. AI detects the fabric for tailored wash &amp; dry,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Laundry Combo) Whomever it belongs to, I know how to treat the fabric right.” The scene cuts to a close-up shot of the clothes being washed along with the disclaimers stating, “AI Wash &amp; Dry +&#39;s detection and sensing capabilities are based on our deep learning models trained using predefined set of data and may yield inaccurate or incorrect results. New datasets may be introduced to our learning models from time to time to enhance its accuracy,” and “Based on AI-based algorithm and internal testing using the AI Wash &amp; Dry + cycle on an IEC 3kg load. A turbidity sensor operates for all weights, while fabric sensing operates for 3kg and under. Actual results may vary depending on individual use.” The scene cuts to a man walking in front of the Bespoke AI Refrigerator Family Hub with the text, “Auto Open Door. Open the fridge effortlessly with a touch or by voice,” at the bottom, the text, “Man) Bixby. Open the fridge door,” and a disclaimer stating, “An automatic closing function is not available. The actual angle that the doors open may vary due to the installation circumstances and usage conditions, like storing heavy items in the door bins. The user may need to adjust how the refrigerator is installed if the doors don&#39;t open properly. The touch sensors can be turned on\/off from the control panel\/display and the default setting is &#39;Off&#39;. The Auto Open Door function may be activated inadvertently by contact with any body part or by a child or pet.” The scene then switches to the inside view of the refrigerator and the man pulls out a cabbage, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Fridge) He prefers light meals.” The woman appears beside him and pulls out chicken breasts, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Fridge) She craves bold flavors.” The couple is seen contemplating, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Fridge) And… in a moment like this?” The scene cuts to the fridge display recommending a Chicken Lettuce Wraps recipe with the text, “AI Food Manager. Smart food management: food item tracking, expiry alerts, and recipes,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Fridge) That’s where I shine!” and a disclaimer stating, “Available on Android and iOS devices. A Wi-Fi connection and a Samsung account are required. Recipe recommendations are limited to recipes registered in the SmartThings Food.” The scene cuts to Chicken Lettuce Wraps prepared on the table and quickly transitions to The Family Hub screen, in which the couple’s friends have rung the bell and are waiting at the front door, along with a disclaimer stating, “The Family Hub screen and doorbell integration service is available only in the following countries: Singapore, Belgium, Switzerland, Czech Republic, Germany, Denmark, Spain, Finland, France, United Kingdom, Italy, Netherlands, Norway, Poland, Sweden, Slovakia, United States, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, Mexico, Colombia, Puerto Rico, and Iceland.” It then cuts to a living room scene with a large TV showing a soccer match and a group of people eating and cheering. The scene cuts to the floor where lots of food crumbs are scattered, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Robot Vacuum) Party’s all fun, but looks like a lot of cleanup ahead.” Then the scene cuts to the Bespoke AI Jet Bot Steam Ultra at its home, and then again at the people cheering enthusiastically and spilling more food on the floor and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Robot Vacuum) Oh no…” The scene cuts to the couple resting on a sofa with the Bespoke AI Jet Bot Steam Ultra cleaning smoothly across the floor with the text stating “Up to 10W Powerful Suction. Thoroughly cleans every mess,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Robot Vacuum) I’ll clean up the floors, so you two can enjoy a little alone time” along with a disclaimer stating, “Able to use 10W suction power at Spot Mode with Vacuum Only, and can last up to 60 min. Based on testing result of Korea Testing Laboratory (KTL), in accordance with KS B 7303:2025 5.1.7. Max suction power was measured with empty dustbin and fully charged battery. Actual results may vary depending on environmental factors.” The scene cuts to the Bespoke AI Laundry Combo automatically opening its door with the text, “Auto Open Door+. Opens to let air out when cycle ends,” along with disclaimers stating, “Auto Open Door+ automatically opens the door and blows air to help remove moisture inside the drum more quickly. The default setting for Auto Open Door is &#39;Open 5 mins later&#39; after a wash-only cycle, and &#39;Open immediately&#39; after a wash &amp; dry cycle or dry-only cycle,” and “Auto Open Door+&#39;s airflow operates only after a wash-only cycle is completed. The default setting for the airflow is Off, and this can be changed in Settings > Washer > Auto Open Door.” Then it cuts to the couple having dinner at the table quickly followed by additional cuts of the Bespoke AI home appliances in use, and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Fridge) And so, they grow closer, understanding each other more,” and “Fridge) With a little help from our peacemaker AIs.” The scene transitions to a single shot of the Bespoke AI Jet Bot Steam Ultra cleaning the floor with the text “Secured by Knox. 3-layer security solution powered by knox,” and On-screen text at the bottom reads, “Robot Vacuum) No worries, your privacy is fully protected!” along with disclaimers stating, “Knox Vault : On device data protection with a built-in security chip,” “Knox Matrix : Security monitoring across samsung devices,” “Verified with the highest Diamond level in the IoT Security Rating by UL Solutions,” “Certified with the highest Standard Plus level in the IoT Cybersecurity by the Korea Internet &amp; Security Agency (KISA),” “Certified by TUV Nord, in compliance with ETSI EN 303 645, Cyber Security for Consumer Internet of Things: Baseline Requirements. Obtained the internationally recognized cybersecurity ETSI EN 303 645 Conformity Mark,” “Received the IT Security label from BSI(Bundesamt fur Sicherheit in der Informationstechnik), which is Federal Office for Information Security of Germany.” In the final scene, the Bespoke AI Jet Bot Steam Ultra slides away from the frame and the video closes with the texts, “Enabling Better Living,” following with, “Bespoke AI,” and finally with the Samsung logo.",
							"autoplay": false}'>
						</div>
					
					
					
					
						
					
