						<div class="text-editor__column-wrap">
							
							<div class="text-editor__column ">
								<p>Samsung washers this week cover every capacity and format. The Samsung Washer WA70H4000SGURT 7kg with Air Turbo is Rs. 71,999 (Rs. 17,000 off), the Samsung Washer WA80CK4240BWRT 8kg with DIT is Rs. 80,999 (Rs. 25,000 off), and the Samsung Washer WA90CK4545BDRT 9kg Ecobubble is Rs. 109,999 (Rs. 25,000 off).</p>
<p>For front-load AI washing, the Samsung Washer WW80FG5L32ABMF 8kg AI Ecobubble with AI Energy is Rs. 199,999 (Rs. 25,000 off). For a complete laundry solution, the Samsung Washer-Dryer Combo WD11BB944DGBGU 11.5+8kg AI Wash is Rs. 299,999 (Rs. 30,000 off).</p>

							</div>
								
