	<!-- [Dialog] Page Type: Common -->
	
		<div class="text-editor    bg-white">
			<div class="text-editor__inner-wrap padding-top--48 padding-bottom--48">
				<div class="text-editor__inner  desktop-padding-left-right--large mobile-padding-left-right--small  ">
					
						<div class="text-editor__column-wrap">
							
							<div class="text-editor__column ">
								<p>This week, Samsung refrigerators span three formats. The Samsung Top Mount Freezer RT53DG7B10B1FA 540L with Twin Cooling is Rs. 376,999 (Rs. 80,000 off). For side-by-side cooling, the Samsung SBS No-Frost Refrigerator RS70F65QEFTR 655L is Rs. 445,999 (Rs. 80,000 off). For single-door options, the Samsung Tall 1 Door Refrigerator RR39M73107F/SG 375L No-Frost is Rs. 278,999 (Rs. 50,000 off).</p>
<p>Beyond refrigeration, the Samsung Dishwasher DW60DG790FSLGU with WaterJet Clean and 14 place settings is Rs. 199,999 (Rs. 30,000 off), and the Samsung Wall-Mount AC AR9500T 18,000 BTU/h with Fast Cooling is Rs. 228,999 (Rs. 11,000 off). All connect through SmartThings for full home automation via your Galaxy phone.</p>

