						<div class="text-editor__column-wrap">
							
							<div class="text-editor__column ">
								<p>The Galaxy A17 8/256GB at Rs. 63,999 (Rs. 19,000 off) is the strongest pick in this range, with a solid balance of performance, storage, and battery. The Galaxy A17 6/128GB is available at Rs. 57,000 (Rs. 10,500 off) for a lower entry point. All A-series purchases include up to 20% off accessories when bundled at checkout and pair naturally with the Galaxy Watch8 44mm at Rs. 89,999 (Rs. 37,000 off).</p>

