						<div class="text-editor__column-wrap">
							
							<div class="text-editor__column ">
								<p>For the latest S26 series, the Galaxy S26 512GB is available at Rs. 356,999 and the Galaxy S26 Ultra at Rs. 424,999 (256GB) or Rs. 489,999 (512GB), both with 30% off the Silicone Magnet Case when bundled at checkout.</p>
<p>For flagship savings, the Galaxy S25 Ultra 512GB at Rs. 355,555 (Rs. 104,444 off) is the standout value: Samsung's powerful previous-generation flagship with the S Pen, a 200MP main camera, a titanium build, and the full Galaxy AI suite. The Galaxy S24 Ultra 1TB at Rs. 329,999 carries the biggest absolute saving in the campaign at Rs. 212,000 off. The Galaxy S25 512GB at Rs. 264,999 (Rs. 70,000 off) delivers the full Galaxy AI experience at a more accessible price, with up to 30% off Galaxy Buds or tablets when bundled at checkout.</p>

